<title>USA: Salomon Inc sets $500 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Salomon Inc sets $500 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Salomon Inc was priced on Wednesday. Salomon Brothers the investment banking arm of the company is lead manger.</p>
<p>BORROWER SALOMON INC</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON 7.20 PCT   MATURITY 02/01/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.917  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 7.215 PCT   PAY FREQ	 N.A</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 81	   CALLABLE	 NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
